":"p11s3","text":"md` on the preset's skill registry, so the skills exist only for that bot.\n- `setup-prompt.md` creat"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"es the bot's scheduled routines through `schedule_create` (enable Plugins > Official > Automation ta"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"s scheduled routines through `schedule_create` (enable Plugins > Official > Automation tasks first)."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Credits and terms"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Every template here was written by the creator named in its README and published on x.ai. This repos"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"itory only reformats them for DeepSeek Harness. Check the marketplace terms before redistributing."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Rebuild"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Generated by `gen_dsh_market.py` in https://github.com/akloster/grok-bot-marketplace-tools (see that"},{"id":"p15s2","text":" repo's README for the full pipeline from the Grok marketplace). After committing bot changes run `."},{"id":"p15s3","text":"/build_index.py` and commit `docs/`."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
